# TMM API Samples

This repository provides sample applications that demonstrate how to use the Trimble Mobile Manager API (TMM API).

## Related documentation

The TMM API documentation lives in a sibling repository named **td-mobile-manager**, located in the same parent directory as this repository:

- This repo: `tmm-api-samples-internal`
- API docs repo: `../td-mobile-manager`

When answering questions about API behavior, endpoints, or specifications, prefer the `td-mobile-manager` repository as the source of truth over guessing from sample code alone.

## Sample applications in this repo

- `maui-sample/` — Cross-platform .NET MAUI (Android, iOS, Windows)
- `android-native-sample/` — Native Android (Kotlin)
- `ios-native-sample/` — Native iOS (Swift)
- `web-sample/` — Web (React + Express)

Public API documentation is also published at https://developer.trimble.com/docs/mobile-manager
